 { As we saw more than once in the previous section, sometimes the defender should be ready to give up material in exchange for activity, and the same goes for the stronger side. We came across several related cases earlier in the book, such as Berkes-Horvath, Karpov-Miles, Kochyev-Hansen, Safarli-Melkumyan and Moskalenko-Arencibia. Here are some more. }  
 *

